note One-time setup, run when the window exists: adapter, device, surface, pipeline, sampler, uniforms, atlas and font. The surface is deliberately configured to a non-sRGB format when one is offered, because the colours in the app are already sRGB and a sRGB target would convert them twice; COPY_SRC is added so a frame can be read back as a screenshot. The sampler is nearest in both directions. Every failure is a StartError, which the loop returns instead of panicking.

