note The context: the window, surface, device and queue, the pipeline and its bind group, the sampler, uniform buffer and atlas texture, the vertex and index buffers kept between frames, the font and the atlas, and the three vectors a frame is replayed into - vertices, indices and the batches that slice them - with the clip current while replaying. size and scale are the window's; the app calls shoot to have the next frame also written to a PNG. Reused buffers hang off it so a steady frame allocates nothing on the GPU.

